### Reports API – Test cases
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000/api/reports

## ===== 1. Summary =====

### 1.1 Summary – mặc định (12 tháng gần nhất)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/summary

### 1.2 Summary – kỳ tùy chọn
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/summary?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-11-26

### 1.3 Summary – from > to -> INVALID_DATE_RANGE 400
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/summary?from=2026-12-01&to=2026-01-01

### 1.4 Summary – kỳ > 60 tháng -> INVALID_DATE_RANGE 400
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/summary?from=2020-01-01&to=2026-11-26

### 1.5 Summary – ngày không tồn tại -> VALIDATION_ERROR 400
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/summary?from=2026-02-31

### 1.6 Summary – định dạng sai -> VALIDATION_ERROR 400
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/summary?from=abc


## ===== 2. Top Equipments =====

### 2.1 Top – mặc định
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/top-equipments

### 2.2 Top – limit=3
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/top-equipments?limit=3

### 2.3 Top – limit=0 -> VALIDATION_ERROR 400
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/top-equipments?limit=0

### 2.4 Top – limit=51 -> VALIDATION_ERROR 400
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/top-equipments?limit=51

### 2.5 Top – kỳ tùy chọn
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/top-equipments?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-06-30&limit=5


## ===== 3. Idle Equipments =====

### 3.1 Idle – mặc định
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/idle-equipments

### 3.2 Idle – page 2
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/idle-equipments?page=1&limit=5

### 3.3 Idle – kỳ rất hẹp (1 ngày, có thể nhiều thiết bị idle)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/idle-equipments?from=2026-11-26&to=2026-11-26


## ===== 4. Monthly Trend =====

### 4.1 Trend – mặc định (12 tháng)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/monthly-trend

### 4.2 Trend – 3 tháng
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/monthly-trend?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-11-26

### 4.3 Trend – from > to -> INVALID_DATE_RANGE 400
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/monthly-trend?from=2027-01-01&to=2026-01-01

